1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Inside every VHS there's a tilted drum
spinning at 1,500 rpm.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,500
The tape crawls along at just
two centimeters per second...

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,500
...but the heads sweep across it
at nearly five meters per second.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,500
Because the drum is tilted, each sweep
writes a diagonal stripe.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,000
Each diagonal stripe is
half a frame of your movie.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,000
That's how two hours fit on 168 meters of tape.
